WEBVTT

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:25.087
Why? Somehow you seem upset
Why? Nandaka ochikonderu mitai

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:33.360
Voice, my voice. I want it to reach you
Voice, my voice. Todoketai yo kimi ni

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:41.930
Things aren't going the way you'd like
Omoi douri ni naranai koto nara

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:50.342
That might happen a lot now, but...
Ima wa takusan attarisuru kedo

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:57.316
Tomorrow, another new wind
Mata ashita wa chigau kaze

00:00:57.624 --> 00:01:00.719
will blow your way
fuite kuru yo

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:05.827
Spread your arms and let your chest
Ryoute wo hirogeta mune ni

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:09.195
just feel the breeze
kanjiru mama

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:14.067
No matter what befalls us,
Nani ga osoi kakattemo

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:17.369
no matter how difficult it may be
semetatete mo

00:01:18.044 --> 00:01:24.541
We'll be all right
Watashi tachi wa daijoubu

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:37.727
A summer day goes by
like a strong gust of wind...

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:41.392
...leaving you with the feeling
that something's going to happen.

00:01:56.149 --> 00:01:58.015
As the summer storms come to an end...

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:01.553
...gradually the seasons change.

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:12.623
The End of Summer

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:36.213
Which way was it?

00:02:36.623 --> 00:02:37.647
This is bad.

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:47.359
Ew! Ew! Ew! What is it?

00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:50.668
Oh, this guy's huge.

00:02:51.771 --> 00:02:53.762
It's the biggest catch this year.

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.872
I'll split the profits with you if someone buys it.

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:59.172
These guys yield a really good
profit when you sell them.

00:02:59.546 --> 00:03:01.913
But out here, people see them
all the time, so no one cares.

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:04.915
Tell me where I can reach you.

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:06.548
Are you from around here?

00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:09.781
Or are you visiting here for summer vacation?

00:03:09.956 --> 00:03:13.119
That's okay. You can keep the money.

00:03:14.561 --> 00:03:15.460
Um...

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.164
Are you lost?

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.530
So, you're from the track team training camp?

00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:29.069
Was it Otowanomori Nishi High School?

00:03:29.442 --> 00:03:31.001
You guys come every year.

00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:35.024
When I visit home around this time,

00:03:35.048 --> 00:03:36.812
| always see girls from the track team.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:38.845
| haven't introduced myself yet.

00:03:39.285 --> 00:03:41.652
I'm Yuki Okazaki. What's your name??

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:43.486
Thank you very much.

00:03:44.457 --> 00:03:46.152
| know my way back from here.

00:03:46.426 --> 00:03:48.827
| can go back to camp myself.

00:03:51.497 --> 00:03:53.488
Go away. Sleaze ball.

00:03:55.702 --> 00:03:58.637
Hey, don't you get tired, being so stuck up?

00:04:02.308 --> 00:04:04.675
Why don't you try to relax a little more?

00:04:04.944 --> 00:04:06.469
That's none of your business!

00:04:07.213 --> 00:04:08.009
You're right!

00:04:14.387 --> 00:04:15.821
Go for it guys! Go for it!

00:04:20.293 --> 00:04:21.761
Come on. Last five hundred meters!

00:04:25.465 --> 00:04:27.276
Look at them go!

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.777
| can't believe they're doing it in this heat.

00:04:28.801 --> 00:04:31.133
They have no choice. It's part of being young!

00:04:32.672 --> 00:04:33.798
Aki! Yumi!

00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:37.219
Don't you guys have anything better to do than...

00:04:37.243 --> 00:04:39.143
...get a hotel room and come see me?

00:04:39.312 --> 00:04:42.475
We have to make the best
of our summer vacation.

00:04:42.649 --> 00:04:44.617
It makes total sense to go to
the mountains after the beach.

00:04:45.118 --> 00:04:47.329
Were Nao and Daisuke doing well?

00:04:47.353 --> 00:04:49.287
Yup, just like last year.

00:04:49.622 --> 00:04:52.523
They took really good care
of us, even the two guys.

00:04:52.759 --> 00:04:56.457
Yeah, it's hard to tell if they
went to hang out or to work.

00:04:57.764 --> 00:04:59.823
The beach brings out the worst in men.

00:05:00.233 --> 00:05:02.911
Makoto and even Kyoichi, who's so serious,

00:05:02.935 --> 00:05:04.680
were drooling over women.

00:05:04.704 --> 00:05:06.604
You should have come too, Chiharu.

00:05:06.706 --> 00:05:09.835
Yeah well, I couldn't so... that's life.

00:05:10.176 --> 00:05:12.321
Nitta! How long are you
planning to take a break?

00:05:12.345 --> 00:05:13.039
O-Okay!

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.846
I'll see you after practice is over.

00:05:17.984 --> 00:05:20.282
Chiharu's enthusiastic as usual!

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:23.390
Of course. This camp is the deciding factor...

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:25.419
...if she's going to be chosen
to enter in the competition.

00:05:25.858 --> 00:05:26.848
On your marks...

00:05:27.126 --> 00:05:27.752
Get set...

00:05:29.195 --> 00:05:30.060
Kyoichi.

00:05:36.636 --> 00:05:37.467
Fine?

00:05:37.837 --> 00:05:39.362
How can you say that!?

00:05:39.739 --> 00:05:41.571
Right now is the most important time.

00:05:41.974 --> 00:05:44.204
| thought you understood that!

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:06.199
Why don't you try to relax a little more?

00:06:29.055 --> 00:06:30.648
You didn't snap a tendon, but...

00:06:30.923 --> 00:06:33.722
...go home for today. Take it
easy for two or three days.

00:06:35.395 --> 00:06:37.727
At this rate, you won't be
eligible for the competition.

00:06:38.698 --> 00:06:41.043
It's okay. It's only a minor setback.

00:06:41.067 --> 00:06:43.229
You'll be able to catch up in no time.

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:49.074
It's perfect timing. Have some fun.
You're in a tourist area. Right Chiharu?

00:06:49.342 --> 00:06:50.275
Chiharu?

00:06:59.285 --> 00:07:00.047
Idiot.

00:07:02.021 --> 00:07:04.888
Hey! Stop slacking off, Kyoichi!

00:07:04.991 --> 00:07:06.925
I-I'm not slacking off...

00:07:10.897 --> 00:07:12.956
Hang in there a little longer.

00:07:13.366 --> 00:07:16.267
Meanwhile, you and I will
endure this hell together.

00:07:16.869 --> 00:07:17.893
Chiharu...

00:07:20.473 --> 00:07:22.771
| wish I'd gone to the beach.

00:07:42.895 --> 00:07:45.921
Close! You have to grab its horn!

00:07:47.066 --> 00:07:48.329
Are you following me?

00:07:48.534 --> 00:07:50.434
Of course not! It's a coincidence.

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:55.965
| was walking by and I saw
you trying to catch the beetle.

00:07:56.609 --> 00:07:58.941
You're wrong! I was trying to shoo it away!

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.947
Anyway, this year's practice must be easy, huh?

00:08:03.316 --> 00:08:04.784
You're done with it already?

00:08:09.322 --> 00:08:11.188
If you have nothing else to say, I'm leaving.

00:08:12.091 --> 00:08:13.115
Hey.

00:08:14.560 --> 00:08:16.153
You're not doing anything now, right?

00:08:17.063 --> 00:08:17.825
No...

00:08:25.304 --> 00:08:26.772
What are you planning?

00:08:28.007 --> 00:08:30.339
What do you think?

00:08:33.079 --> 00:08:34.274
It's a date.

00:08:35.181 --> 00:08:35.909
A date?

00:08:42.588 --> 00:08:43.646
What's so funny?

00:08:45.491 --> 00:08:47.516
H...Hey! Ow!

00:08:55.701 --> 00:08:57.135
It's eating it!

00:08:58.137 --> 00:09:01.368
| was supposed to make a profit
off of him. Now I'm in the red.

00:09:10.683 --> 00:09:11.673
May I ask why?

00:09:12.285 --> 00:09:16.745
Because I'm driving. I'll get caught for
drunk driving if I drink anything...

00:09:16.822 --> 00:09:17.687
That's not what I mean.

00:09:18.224 --> 00:09:20.955
Why did you ask me out, Okazaki?

00:09:21.193 --> 00:09:23.321
Will your boyfriend get mad at me?

00:09:25.731 --> 00:09:27.631
| don't have a boyfriend...

00:09:28.501 --> 00:09:29.127
Really?

00:09:29.769 --> 00:09:34.263
Yes. Come on, Okazaki. You just assumed...

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:35.505
| see...

00:09:35.808 --> 00:09:37.105
But if I had one,

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.369
he wouldn't get mad, I think...

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:42.209
What a great boyfriend.

00:09:42.915 --> 00:09:44.178
You think so?

00:09:45.151 --> 00:09:46.710
Of course, that's if he existed though.

00:09:48.521 --> 00:09:49.331
Yeah...

00:09:49.355 --> 00:09:50.652
Can I take you to one more place?

00:09:56.095 --> 00:09:56.926
Where are we?

00:09:57.396 --> 00:09:59.023
My favorite destination.

00:10:00.333 --> 00:10:00.959
Look.

00:10:07.239 --> 00:10:08.638
This is my special place.

00:10:09.408 --> 00:10:12.969
All your worries get blown
away when you see this view.

00:10:18.317 --> 00:10:19.409
It's beautiful...

00:10:19.752 --> 00:10:21.880
| wanted to show you this.

00:10:22.788 --> 00:10:23.755
To me?

00:10:33.165 --> 00:10:34.098
Chiharu...

00:10:34.667 --> 00:10:37.136
Thank you... Thank you...

00:11:38.464 --> 00:11:39.932
Okay! Great time guys.

00:11:40.166 --> 00:11:42.464
We'll do great at our next meet.

00:11:44.236 --> 00:11:45.328
Nitta,
Chiharu

00:12:11.997 --> 00:12:14.193
What are you looking for, Chiharu?

00:12:16.669 --> 00:12:18.603
Look! Look! Look how many I caught!

00:12:18.938 --> 00:12:22.465
What a great summer pastime, you can
do it as a hobby and for profit!

00:12:22.708 --> 00:12:24.619
| wish you weren't in it for the money...

00:12:24.643 --> 00:12:26.488
Hey, Chiharu, come join us.

00:12:26.512 --> 00:12:28.241
I'm sorry, not today...

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:32.408
| see... Yeah, you have
to let your leg heal.

00:12:32.651 --> 00:12:34.119
I'm sorry. I'll see you later!

00:12:36.655 --> 00:12:38.987
She seems depressed...

00:12:39.492 --> 00:12:42.189
Don't you think it's better
to tell her about Kyoichi?

00:12:42.428 --> 00:12:44.226
That's why we're keeping it as a secret!

00:12:44.663 --> 00:12:47.325
That way she'll be happier when she sees him.

00:13:18.063 --> 00:13:19.053
Okazaki...

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:22.424
Okazaki.

00:13:23.202 --> 00:13:24.067
Chiharu...

00:13:24.436 --> 00:13:26.803
Umm... you caught something.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:31.877
Damn...

00:13:39.852 --> 00:13:42.082
All we're doing is hanging out.

00:13:42.154 --> 00:13:44.316
Of course! It's our summer vacation.

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:47.787
This is my last long vacation.

00:13:48.194 --> 00:13:51.061
Right. This is your senior year in college.

00:13:51.797 --> 00:13:54.425
Are you going back home after you graduate?

00:13:54.633 --> 00:13:58.661
Yeah, but how did you know I was here?

00:13:58.904 --> 00:14:03.705
Because... you love it here.
Even the view from that cliff...

00:14:04.276 --> 00:14:06.108
It makes me happy to hear you say that.

00:14:07.046 --> 00:14:08.810
| wish everyone was like you.

00:14:17.089 --> 00:14:19.615
Wear this. It's getting breezy.

00:14:19.792 --> 00:14:20.884
Thank you.

00:14:27.333 --> 00:14:28.027
Hello?

00:14:28.734 --> 00:14:29.826
Oh, it's you...

00:14:30.236 --> 00:14:31.726
So, what do you want?

00:14:33.939 --> 00:14:34.804
Yeah, I know.

00:14:36.742 --> 00:14:38.107
How many times have I...

00:14:39.144 --> 00:14:41.078
No, I've already decided.

00:14:41.847 --> 00:14:43.212
Getting a job in Tokyo is...

00:14:43.949 --> 00:14:46.509
| am thinking about you! But...

00:14:48.287 --> 00:14:49.448
Yeah, you're right.

00:14:50.256 --> 00:14:51.485
Quit smoking, all right?

00:14:52.892 --> 00:14:55.156
Yeah, but it's none of your business.

00:14:57.563 --> 00:14:59.361
Sorry you had to see that.

00:15:00.065 --> 00:15:03.558
Hey, do you think I'll be
able to catch a bigger one?

00:15:59.325 --> 00:16:01.191
Yes, this is the Marine House.

00:16:02.695 --> 00:16:05.255
Hello? May I ask who this is?

00:16:05.664 --> 00:16:06.426
Who is it?

00:16:07.866 --> 00:16:10.267
If this is a prank call, you're out of luck.

00:16:10.502 --> 00:16:12.869
There're only sweaty guys here.

00:16:13.339 --> 00:16:14.170
Kyoichi...

00:16:15.808 --> 00:16:16.604
Chiharu?

00:16:17.042 --> 00:16:19.636
| had no idea it was you.

00:16:19.878 --> 00:16:21.243
Did you need something?

00:16:21.647 --> 00:16:24.014
Kyoichi... I...

00:16:25.451 --> 00:16:29.615
Kyoichi... are you... angry at me?

00:16:30.489 --> 00:16:32.787
What? I can't hear you very well.

00:16:33.525 --> 00:16:35.584
Hey! Makoto! Shut up!

00:16:35.995 --> 00:16:37.360
Jeez, it's busy.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:41.332
Single, sweaty guys have
nothing else to do but work!

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:43.962
I'm sorry. What were you saying?

00:16:44.169 --> 00:16:47.764
Well...

00:16:49.041 --> 00:16:50.907
| might be falling in love...

00:16:52.277 --> 00:16:53.403
What? I can't hear you.

00:16:55.214 --> 00:16:57.273
I'm sorry, but I'm still on the clock.

00:16:57.449 --> 00:16:58.644
Can you call me later?

00:16:58.884 --> 00:17:00.579
Anytime later is fine. See ya.

00:17:19.872 --> 00:17:20.600
Hello?

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:22.136
Um...

00:17:23.042 --> 00:17:23.770
Chiharu?

00:17:25.444 --> 00:17:27.208
Yes. It is.

00:17:27.379 --> 00:17:28.744
What is it? What's wrong?

00:17:32.951 --> 00:17:35.943
Will you meet me tonight?

00:17:38.924 --> 00:17:42.588
Perfect timing. I wanted to see you.

00:17:47.099 --> 00:17:49.363
Okazaki, I...

00:17:49.935 --> 00:17:51.460
I'm going back to Tokyo tomorrow.

00:17:54.106 --> 00:17:56.165
Tonight's my last day of summer vacation.

00:17:57.342 --> 00:18:02.712
| have to start going to work, doing my
thesis... It's going to get busy again.

00:18:03.348 --> 00:18:04.816
Tonight's the last night I can hang out.

00:18:07.486 --> 00:18:08.248
Chiharu...

00:18:09.154 --> 00:18:11.919
Will you take me there please?

00:18:13.659 --> 00:18:15.286
Can I ask you something?

00:18:16.095 --> 00:18:19.874
Did you ever bring your girlfriend here?

00:18:19.898 --> 00:18:23.459
No, you're the first girl
I've ever brought here.

00:18:24.703 --> 00:18:26.831
I'd be happy if that were true.

00:18:32.177 --> 00:18:33.645
Summer's almost over.

00:19:19.658 --> 00:19:23.060
No, stop. You shouldn't do that, Nao...

00:19:25.531 --> 00:19:27.693
| wonder if Chiharu will like it?

00:19:31.703 --> 00:19:33.034
I'll take you back.

00:19:33.172 --> 00:19:33.900
It's okay.

00:19:34.273 --> 00:19:36.207
| wouldn't want any rumors to start.

00:19:36.308 --> 00:19:39.141
Don't tell your boyfriend
we were out all night.

00:19:39.278 --> 00:19:40.746
But nothing happened.

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:43.874
All we did was talk all night.

00:19:44.016 --> 00:19:44.983
That's why.

00:19:46.185 --> 00:19:47.152
Al right.

00:19:47.686 --> 00:19:50.417
Takahara Station

00:19:56.328 --> 00:19:57.261
| had a lot of fun.

00:19:58.096 --> 00:20:00.360
Me too. I'm glad I met you.

00:20:01.033 --> 00:20:02.010
You're such an adult.

00:20:02.034 --> 00:20:03.263
That's not true...

00:20:05.070 --> 00:20:07.630
Adults are so unfair.

00:20:07.773 --> 00:20:08.433
Yeah...

00:20:32.097 --> 00:20:32.893
Goodbye.

00:20:34.366 --> 00:20:35.128
Goodbye.

00:20:58.257 --> 00:20:59.691
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:21:00.292 --> 00:21:02.090
Now that I'm refreshed...

00:21:02.361 --> 00:21:04.625
...let's head over to the camp
where your dear barbarian awaits!

00:21:05.631 --> 00:21:06.223
Kyoichi?

00:21:07.332 --> 00:21:09.164
Huh? Is that Nitta?

00:21:09.935 --> 00:21:13.098
What? We kept it a secret that we're coming.

00:21:13.305 --> 00:21:14.215
What is this?

00:21:14.239 --> 00:21:15.832
Are you guys telepathically connected?

00:21:17.009 --> 00:21:19.979
A summer day goes by like
a strong gust of wind...

00:21:20.946 --> 00:21:23.438
...leaving you with the feeling
that something's going to happen.

00:21:24.716 --> 00:21:26.377
As the summer storms come to an end...

00:21:26.952 --> 00:21:29.649
...gradually the seasons change.

00:21:31.857 --> 00:21:34.519
There's no reason,
Riyuu nanka nakute

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:40.426
we're just happy when we're together
issho nara ureshiku nattari

00:21:41.099 --> 00:21:49.099
Somehow we connect, everyone together
Nanto naku tsuuji au minna ga ii ne

00:21:57.449 --> 00:22:02.478
We lay down on the riverbed
Kawara no shamen nekoron da

00:22:02.721 --> 00:22:05.520
stretching our arms and legs
teashi wo nobashite

00:22:06.758 --> 00:22:14.563
Birds flew above our heads
Atama no ue wo tori tachi ga tobitatta

00:22:16.068 --> 00:22:20.528
I just look up at the sky
Futo miageta kyou no sora

00:22:20.772 --> 00:22:23.673
it seems to spread forever
doko mademo hirogaru

00:22:24.242 --> 00:22:29.457
All the things bothering me
Donna yuutsu na koto demo

00:22:29.481 --> 00:22:34.282
<i>seem so small
chiisaku omoeru yo</i>

00:22:37.055 --> 00:22:39.901
There's no reason,
Riyuu nanka nakute

00:22:39.925 --> 00:22:45.887
we just sing our favorite songs
suki na uta kuchi zusande tari

00:22:46.331 --> 00:22:54.331
That's the best, that's when it feels great
Sonna toki ga ichiban kimochi ga ii ne

00:23:01.012 --> 00:23:02.023
Next Episode

00:23:02.047 --> 00:23:03.825
Next Episode A swallow, the
fall breeze, cultural festival...

00:23:03.849 --> 00:23:04.145
A swallow, the fall breeze,
cultural festival...

00:23:04.883 --> 00:23:06.408
| hate not having any confidence.

00:23:06.651 --> 00:23:07.846
| want to be stronger.

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:09.617
| want to be more honest.

00:23:10.655 --> 00:23:12.589
Yes, like her...

00:23:12.891 --> 00:23:13.868
Circular Dance ~ 16 Moonlit Nights

00:23:13.892 --> 00:23:15.036
Circular Dance ~ 16 Moonlit Nights
Next episode of Boys Be...

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:15.570
Circular Dance ~ 16 Moonlit Nights

00:23:15.594 --> 00:23:16.971
Circular Dance ~ 16 Moonlit Nights
Circular Dance ~ 16 Moonlit Nights.

00:23:16.995 --> 00:23:17.291
Circular Dance ~ 16 Moonlit Nights

00:23:18.130 --> 00:23:20.690
Chiharu... the season changed.
